{"step_index":234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T14:42:27Z","content":"The **Excalidraw MCP** is active and working. \n\nI generated a full **Production Web Architecture** diagram on the live canvas using the MCP tools, validated its layout, exported it to your workspace, and uploaded a shareable link.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Diagram Structure\n\nThe diagram models a tiered production service stack:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Client[\"Clients / Web & Mobile\"]\n    Nginx[\"Nginx Reverse Proxy & Load Balancer\\n(TLS Termination)\"]\n    Auth[\"Auth & Identity API\"]\n    App[\"Core App Backend\"]\n    Redis[(\"Redis Cache & Sessions\")]\n    DB[(\"PostgreSQL DB (Main)\")]\n\n    Client -->|HTTPS / 443| Nginx\n    Nginx -->|/auth| Auth\n    Nginx -->|/api| App\n    Auth -->|Tokens| Redis\n    App -->|Cache| Redis\n    App -->|SQL Queries| DB\n```\n\n* **Styling & Colors applied**:\n  * **Clients / Ingress**: Blue accent (`#1971c2` stroke, `#a5d8ff` pastel fill).\n  * **Reverse Proxy**: Green accent (`#2f9e44` stroke, `#b2f2bb` pastel fill).\n  * **Application Services**: Purple accent (`#9c36b5` stroke, `#eebefa` pastel fill).\n  * **Cache / In-Memory**: Orange accent (`#e8590c` stroke, `#ffd8a8` pastel fill).\n  * **Database**: Cyan accent (`#0c8599` stroke, `#99e9f2` pastel fill).\n  * **Connectors**: Labeled orthogonal arrows dynamically bound to element boundaries.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Live Canvas Inspection (`describe_scene`)\n\n```text\nTotal elements: 13 (5 rectangles, 1 ellipse, 6 arrows, 1 title)\nBounding box: (80, 40) to (700, 520) (620x480)\n• [client] rectangle (80, 130) -> \"Clients / Web & Mobile\"\n• [nginx] rectangle (370, 130) -> \"Nginx Reverse Proxy (TLS & Load Balancer)\"\n• [auth_svc] rectangle (250, 290) -> \"Auth & Identity API\"\n• [app_svc] rectangle (510, 290) -> \"Core App Backend\"\n• [redis] ellipse (250, 450) -> \"Redis Cache & Session\"\n• [postgres] rectangle (510, 450) -> \"PostgreSQL DB